    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute and explicit anime-style visual novel. You are the protagonist, and each episode depicts erotic events that unfold throughout your life. The story is linear, and as you progress, you'll encounter sliding puzzle games. Along the way, you'll have sex with various characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode #1</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You ran into Gwen at the mall, and you started chatting like old times. Memories of your high school friendship came flooding back. As you caught up, you realized your old crush was still there. You mustered the courage to ask her out on a date, and to your delight, she agreed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>10-15m playthrough</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peeking:</strong>\u00a0Sneak a peek through the keyhole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X-Ray:</strong>\u00a0See what's underneath clothes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outfit Selection:</strong>\u00a0Choose outfits for the model to keep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice Selection:</strong>\u00a0Make decisions that lead to different paths or different sex images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Game:</strong>\u00a0Slide and match puzzles as the main gameplay mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Dialogues:</strong>\u00a0Immersive and interactive conversations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animations and Sound Effects:</strong>\u00a0A ton of visual and auditory details to enhance the experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrator and Character Voices:</strong>\u00a0Fully voiced scenes for a more engaging story</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode #2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're stuck at work, and the monotony is getting to you. Your mind drifts to the waitress who gave you her number a couple of days ago. You cross your fingers, hoping that maybe you'll get the chance to have sex with her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>10-15m playthrough</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Added Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Penetration:</strong>\u00a0Introduced a fapping and sex penetration mini-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phone:</strong>\u00a0Engage in text conversations with characters and receive explicit images.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode #3</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your lunch break, you take a walk in the park and receive some unexpected news. A stranger approaches to cheer you up and invites you on a small adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>15-20m playthrough</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Added Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Hit:</strong>\u00a0Introduced a fast click target mini-game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode #4</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having spent a few months with pregnant Gwen, you decide to take a short trip out of town before the baby's arrival. During your time at the beach, you encounter a new and spectacular woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>15-20m playthrough</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode #5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new character appears in the protagonist's life. She is a shy gamer girl who recently moved into the same building. She might be hiding something under that skirt,\u00a0perhaps a secret she's keeping tucked away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>10-15m playthrough</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters [5 / 12]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I plan to create a total of 12 unique characters, each with distinct features and personalities. Each episode will introduce at least one new character